{
  "slug": "sculpture",
  "name": "Sculpture",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Sculpture removes AI capabilities instead of restricting them. Start with a full Claude agent and sculpt away everything it doesn't need — web search, file access, code execution, computer control. What remains is provably safe: not because of rules, but because the capability doesn't exist. Rules can be ignored. Removed capabilities cannot. Includes three enforcement walls (tool stripping, hallucination interception, context shaping), 5 pre-built templates, and a compliance audit report generator.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `sculpture-guide`\n- **Agents** (1): `sculptor` (Expert agent that helps users decide what AI capabilities to remove based on their use case)\n- **Commands** (1): `sculpture`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sculpture@claude-community` from `Prajhan26/sculpture-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
